# 31. Important Boundary

Phase 3 must NOT automatically change the agent's behavior by modifying:

```text
System prompt
Python source code
Agent configuration
Model weights
```

Instead:

```text
Evaluation
   ↓
Lesson
   ↓
Future retrieval
   ↓
Future context
```

This provides a controlled form of learning.

