# 57. Definition of Done

Phase 3 is complete when:

* [ ] Phase 2 functionality continues to work.
* [ ] Main Agent works with persistent memory.
* [ ] Evaluator is implemented.
* [ ] Evaluations are persisted.
* [ ] Correct/incorrect/unknown evaluation is supported.
* [ ] Quality is recorded.
* [ ] Confidence is recorded.
* [ ] Evaluation reasoning is recorded.
* [ ] Learner is implemented.
* [ ] Lessons can be generated.
* [ ] Lessons can be persisted.
* [ ] Lesson confidence is stored.
* [ ] Lessons can be embedded.
* [ ] Lessons can be retrieved through sqlite-vec.
* [ ] GraphQLite relationships are implemented.
* [ ] Experience → Evaluation relationship works.
* [ ] Evaluation → Lesson relationship works.
* [ ] Relevant lessons are included in future agent context.
* [ ] Streamlit displays evaluations.
* [ ] Streamlit displays lessons.
* [ ] Streamlit displays learning traces.
* [ ] Streamlit displays graph relationships.
* [ ] Streamlit remains read-only.
* [ ] Evaluation failures do not break the main response.
* [ ] Learning failures do not break the main response.
* [ ] Automated tests pass.
* [ ] Persistence works across application restarts.
* [ ] No strategy optimization is implemented.
* [ ] No automatic prompt/code modification is implemented.
* [ ] No model training/fine-tuning is implemented.

