# 58. Phase 3 Final Architecture

At the end of Phase 3, the system should conceptually look like:

```
                     ┌─────────────────┐
                     │     ADK Web     │
                     └────────┬────────┘
                              │
                              ▼
                     ┌─────────────────┐
                     │   Main Agent    │
                     └────────┬────────┘
                              │
                ┌─────────────┴─────────────┐
                ▼                           ▼
         Experience Memory            Lesson Memory
            sqlite-vec                 sqlite-vec
                │                           │
                └─────────────┬─────────────┘
                              ▼
                     ┌─────────────────┐
                     │ Context Builder │
                     └────────┬────────┘
                              │
                              ▼
                          Llama 3.2
                              │
                              ▼
                            Answer
                              │
                              ▼
                     ┌─────────────────┐
                     │    Evaluator    │
                     └────────┬────────┘
                              │
                              ▼
                         Evaluation
                              │
                              ▼
                     ┌─────────────────┐
                     │     Learner     │
                     └────────┬────────┘
                              │
                              ▼
                           Lesson
                              │
                ┌─────────────┴─────────────┐
                ▼                           ▼
             SQLite                     GraphQLite
                │                           │
                │                    Relationships
                │                           │
                └─────────────┬─────────────┘
                              │
                              ▼
                     ┌─────────────────┐
                     │    Streamlit    │
                     │ Developer View  │
                     └─────────────────┘
```

The resulting system should demonstrate:

**Remember → Answer → Evaluate → Learn → Remember the lesson.**

Phase 4 will build on this foundation by introducing **strategy selection and strategy optimization** rather than simply storing lessons.
